     "text": "All the cookie values are encrypted. Chrome encrypts cookies using DPAPI on Windows. The `value` column is empty and the actual values are in `encrypted_value`. To decrypt them, I need to use the Chrome encryption key from the Local State file.\n\nLet me write a script that:\n1. Reads the encryption key from Chrome's Local State\n2. Decrypts the cookies using DPAPI\n3. Exports them in Netscape format",
